sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User
    participant ALB as ALB
    participant OSCAL as OSCAL App
    participant Bedrock as AWS Bedrock

    User->>ALB: Access Application
    ALB->>OSCAL: Route to Green/Blue
    OSCAL->>User: Render UI

    Note over User,OSCAL: Viewing reports - no AI call

    User->>OSCAL: Click "AI Suggest"
    OSCAL->>Bedrock: Invoke Model API
    Bedrock->>OSCAL: AI Response
    OSCAL->>User: Display Suggestions

    Note over OSCAL,Bedrock: Bedrock is pay-per-use<br/>No wake/sleep or scaling
